Attack the target with either your ranged or melee weapons for [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] damage.

If the attack hits you'll breach the target's immunities, reducing armor hardiness, stun, pin, blindness, and confusion immunity by 50% for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.

Breach chance scales with your Spellpower.
